I see a woman.
She smiles at me.
She is friendly.
She says: "Hello."
"Welcome to Denmark," she says.
I smile too.
"Thank you very much," I say.
"My name is Lena," she says.
"What is your name?"
I say: "My name is Maya."
"Where do you come from, Maya?"
"I come from Mexico," I say.
She says: "I come from Denmark."
She is Danish.
It is a friendly hello.
